---
name: panels/todo-list
description: "Panel line: when the model should answer from the user's own todos, including the filter mapping."
version: 1
output: json
variables: [filters]
---
todo_list {filter: {{filters}}} whenever the request involves the user's OWN todos or tasks (show/list/filter them, check what is left, plan a day around them, summarize progress): it renders their REAL rows, so it is the only component allowed to answer with todo content. Pick the slice the user asked for: open/pending/remaining/left/active/unfinished => open; done/completed/finished => done; all ONLY when the user asks for everything or for completed rows too — a request about what is left is NEVER all. Always send filter inside props. Never for greetings, thanks or other smalltalk
